{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 29, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark hark good traveler of fair Japanesque dream\nVerily thy six days journey doth begin in fairest Tokyo\nWhere neon lights do dance with ancient shrine bright\nOn morn of first day thou shalt awaken early\nTo the call of temple bell in Asakusa’s embrace\nPray at Senso-ji ‘neath lanterns gold\nThen wander through streets where samurai ghosts do tread\nPartake of matcha sweet in a teahouse old\nFor dinner let thy taste buds feign delight\nWith sushi fresh as morning dew\nAnd ramen rich as highwayman’s purse\nOn second day let thy feet take thee east\nTo Nikko’s woods where kami spirits feast\nToshogu shrine doth gleam with gold so fine\nAnd Kegon Falls do whisper secrets divine\nDo climb to Lake Chuzenji’s glassy face\nWhere mountain peaks do kiss the sky’s embrace\nReturn to Tokyo where Shibuya’s scrum do tease\nYet let thy soul find peace in Shinjuku’s trees\nOn third day the bullet train shall bear thee swift\nTo Kyoto’s past where time doth drift\nFushimi Inari’s torii gates do rise\nA crimson tide ‘neath cherry skies\nAt Gion thou shalt spy maiko’s grace\nAnd eat takoyaki in Kyocera’s place\nOn fourth day let Nara’s deer lead thy way\nThrough Todai-ji where Buddha doth survey\nCast crumbs to creatures bold and free\nThen ride the ropeway high into the sea\nWhere Kurama’s temple doth stand so grand\nAnd Arashiyama’s bamboo doth sing its hand\nEat mochi sweet at Nishiki’s stall\nWith matcha tea to wash it all\nOn fifth day return thou to Osaka’s cheer\nWhere street food kings do rule with flair\nDotonbori’s neon lights do gleam\nAnd crab legs taste like heaven’s dream\nVisit Osaka Castle grand and stately\nWhere history’s ghosts in stone do dwell so neatly\nOn final day let thy heart return to Tokyo’s heart\nWhere Harajuku’s quirks do play their part\nVisit Meiji Shrine where gods do dwell\nAnd take a boat on Shinjuku’s gleaming well\nTo Odaiba where futures bold are cast\nAnd Rainbow Bridge doth kiss the sky’s vast\nLet thy journey end where it began\nWith sushi fresh and sake well-drawn\nGood morrow fair traveler now depart\nAnd may thy days in Japan impart\nThe wonders old and joys anew\nIn this land where east and west do brew.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.1340528428554535}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0035872412845492363}, {"token": " h", "logprob": -1.6715590953826904}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.00344089069403708}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -0.45819392800331116}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.43129584193229675}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.001321157906204462}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -1.9770054817199707}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -3.7631173133850098}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.4386307001113892}, {"token": "es", "logprob": -3.4932937622070312}, {"token": "que", "logprob": -0.05275317281484604}, {"token": " dream", "logprob": -2.863381862640381}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.06742537766695023}, {"token": "Ver", "logprob": -3.3048782348632812}, {"token": "ily", "logprob": -0.000998594332486391}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -2.067538261413574}, {"token": " six", "logprob": -5.217746734619141}, {"token": " days", "logprob": -0.31496796011924744}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -1.2900099754333496}, {"token": " d", "logprob": -1.5554144382476807}, {"token": "oth", "logprob": -2.2649508537142538e-05}, {"token": " begin", "logprob": -1.7811938524246216}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -2.044205665588379}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.7361538410186768}, {"token": "est", "logprob": -1.4586697816848755}, {"token": " Tokyo", "logprob": -0.4466647505760193}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.8879778981208801}, {"token": "Where", "logprob": -1.7524207830429077}, {"token": " neon", "logprob": -1.5353858470916748}, {"token": " lights", "logprob": -0.437518835067749}, {"token": " do", "logprob": -0.3338296115398407}, {"token": " dance", "logprob": -0.2810871